  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/5ea2ecb3f91b7dc04e3fa621e1ba6f2aa7ddc621.png\" alt=\"No More Pop-ups 橫幅\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffabricmc.net%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/supported/fabric_64h.png\" alt=\"Fabric\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fquiltmc.org%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/supported/quilt_64h.png\" alt=\"Quilt\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffiles.minecraftforge.net%252fnet%252fminecraftforge%252fforge%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/supported/forge_64h.png\" alt=\"Forge\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fneoforged.net%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/intergrav/devins-badges/8494ec1ac495cfb481dc7e458356325510933eb0/assets/cozy/supported/neoforge_64h.png\" alt=\"NeoForge\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/Alfakynz/No-More-Popups\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/github_64h.png\" alt=\"GitHub\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fproject%252fsAdB6HVW\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/modrinth_64h.png\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/no-more-popups\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/curseforge_64h.png\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/TcmUQHZ5U4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/social/discord-plural_64h.png\" alt=\"Discord\"></a></p>\n<h2>✨ 功能特色</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>移除 <em>「食譜已解鎖！」</em> 彈出視窗</li>\n<li>移除教學彈出視窗</li>\n<li>移除成就彈出視窗</li>\n<li>移除系統彈出視窗</li>\n<li>移除資源包警告</li>\n<li>移除多人遊戲警告</li>\n<li>移除實驗性世界警告</li>\n<li>移除聊天室中的成就訊息（預設關閉）</li>\n<li>內含設定選項，可自訂顯示哪些彈出視窗（需搭配 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmodmenu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ModMenu</a> 與 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcloth-config\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cloth Config API</a> 使用）</li>\n<li>移除部分模組的彈出視窗或訊息（預設為否）：<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fproject%252fJaNmzvA8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Chunks Fade In</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fproject%252fx1hIzbuY\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">FastQuit</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fproject%252f9KawNmQc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">FrozenLib (Wilder Wild)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fproject%252fXrxtjryC\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Nether Weather</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fproject%252f8oi3bsk5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Terralith</a></li></ul></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>🔄 版本支援</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Minecraft</th>\n<th>Fabric</th>\n<th>Forge</th>\n<th>NeoForge</th>\n<th>Quilt</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>1.20.1</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1.20.2-4</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1.20.5-6</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1.21.1-8</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1.21.9-11</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>26.1.x</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>Fabric &gt;= 0.16.4 / 0.18.4 <br>\nForge &gt;= 47.1.47 <br>\nNeoForge &gt;= 21.1.229 / 26.1.0.1-beta</p>\n<h2>🚀 未來規劃</h2>\n<p>目前暫無規劃，但歡迎隨時提出您想要的功能建議！</p>\n<h2>📦 整合包</h2>\n<p>歡迎將 No More Pop-ups 納入您的整合包中。</p>\n<h2>🌐 尋找伺服器？同時支持我！</h2>\n<p>想和朋友一起玩嗎？透過 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwabbanode.com%252faffiliate%252fwildlight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wabbanode</a> 建立屬於自己的伺服器。</p>\n<p>使用優惠碼 <strong>WILDLIGHT</strong> 支持我，即可享受八折優惠。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwabbanode.com%252faffiliate%252fwildlight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/hvk4z0Vv/banner-3.png\" alt=\"Wabbanode 伺服器\"></a></p>",
